# Submitted inquiries — contains real email addresses, never commit
.data/

# The repo root .gitignore carries a broad `data/` rule (for Paperclip's own
# runtime data dirs) which matches any directory named `data` at any depth —
# including this app's src/data/, silently excluding the specimen and journal
# content the app cannot build without. Re-include it here.
# Un-ignoring the directory itself is required first: a file cannot be
# re-included while a parent directory is still excluded.
!src/data/
!src/data/**
